# Sample 15 — Coincident markers (×N)
#
# Three feeders happen to share the same rating. Spec §Layout step 9:
# identical positions combine into one marker with ×N, listing every
# name in the gutter, rather than drawing three indistinguishable
# stacked dots.

diagram "Coincident load ratings" {
  below "Feeder 1 rating" must 5 kA
  below "Feeder 2 rating" must 5 kA
  below "Feeder 3 rating" must 5 kA
  above "Minimum fault" must 8 kA margin 10%

  selected "Setting" 6 kA
}
